# Check text files out with LF on every system (Windows Git defaults to
# CRLF). The configs, seeds and sources here are read by tools that expect
# the same bytes on macOS and Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
# cmd.exe misreads labels / goto in LF-only batch files: keep them CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
